 MAINTAINERS                                   |  10 +
 .../boot/dts/exynos/exynos9820-pinctrl.dtsi   | 651 ++++++++++++++++++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos9820.dtsi    | 467 +++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 1128 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos9820-pinctrl.dtsi
